+With `streamText: true`, text from the owned Agent's active prompt reaches `agent_message_chunk` as it arrives, in block order. Committed text is not replayed; thoughts, tool updates, images, and usage retain their committed delivery. A failed or abandoned attempt after published text fails the prompt instead of joining a replacement answer to its prefix. Consumers must stop playback on failure or cancellation and cannot retract text already delivered. Only enable this on a provider whose text stream is suitable for public output.
+
 ### Start a server
 
 `pnpm dsh --profile acp` starts the shipped stdio server. The `acp` profile mounts session persistence, so clients can list, resume, and close persistent sessions. [`@deepseek-ai/dsh-subagent-acp`](../../subagent/subagent-acp/README.md) starts the same profile for out-of-process delegation.
